# NablaMimic on NablaEngine (the fused differentiable engine), the recommended configuration: residual actions, i.e.
# the joint setpoints are the next reference frame's joint angles plus the scaled action instead of the default pose
# plus the scaled action, with the reward unchanged (the action-rate term on the commanded setpoints, the default
# --action-rate-space setpoint), on the 0.2.0 defaults of base/ours.args (no objective cut after an episode end inside
# a window, the evaluation scores the actor's Polyak average, 100-update learning-rate warmup). 3 h of training. The
# absolute-action recipe of the reported v0.1.0 comparisons: configs/reported/ours_absolute.args.
@base/ours.args
--physics engine --residual-action
--hours 3
